N upsetplot.pkg
D  7 May 2025
U 43
d 'UPSETPLOT': module to show Euler or Venn diagrams mapped to bar charts, upsetplot style
d 
d  upsetplot produces a bar chart alternative to Euler or Venn
d diagrams showing the frequencies (or more generally abundances)
d of subsets of observations as defined jointly by a bundle of
d numeric indicator variables and possibly a weight variable. The
d plot resembles what have been called UpSetPlots elsewhere. The
d display uses various subcommands of graph twoway.  The most
d distinctive feature is a matrix- or table-like legend below the
d bar chart with marker symbols shown on each row whenever any
d indicator is 1 in a subset. Correspondingly, absence of a marker
d symbol implies that that indicator is 0 in that subset. The
d reduced dataset used by upsetplot may be saved for future work.
d 
d KW: upsetplot
d KW: Euler diagram
d KW: Venn diagram
d KW: bar charts
d KW: graphics
d KW: genomics
d 
d Requires: Stata version 8.2
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20231203
d 
d Author: Tim Morris, MRC Clinical Trials Unit at UCL
d Support: email T.Morris@@ctu.mrc.ac.uk
d 
d Author: Nicholas J. Cox, Durham University
d Support: email N.J.Cox@@durham.ac.uk
d 
f u\upsetplot.ado
f u\upsetplot.sthlp
f s\sortmean.ado
f s\sortmean.sthlp
